//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md05/025en0010a14'>
//《……何ぃ!?》
《They dispelled it!?》

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md05/025en0020a14'>
//《我が<RUBY text='フェアリーズ'>魔王星</RUBY>を――蒸発させた!?》
《Impossible!》

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md05/025en0030a15'>
//《あの謎を解いたのか……!?》
《You㉓<I>solved</I>㉒it!》

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md05/025en0040a15'>
//《なれにそれ程の才が――いや》
《It seems I underestimated your―  No. You did not do this alone.》


//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md05/025en0050a15'>
//《仕手の思考力をも利用したればこそか》
《Your master's mind and yours were one. That alone made this possible.》

//【二世村正】
<voice name='二世村正' class='二世村正' src='voice/md05/025en0060a15'>
//《そこまでの事ができる程、仕手との一致を
//成したのか……！》
《Incredible! Such oneness... I never imagined!》

//　第一段階、拘束状態の解除――完了。
//　第二段階、辰気圏よりの一時脱出――完了。

//　第三段階――
  Step one complete. Control established.
  Step two complete. Position stable.

  Step three―

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md05/025en0070a14'>
//《おのれ！　逃がさぬ!!》
《Get back here, damn you!》
